    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48544" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεσπῐῳδ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
